*>   2009-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 293
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0003.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY LON0003C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RATE-ADJUSTMENT    PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-LTV-RULES
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJUSTMENT=" RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    STOP RUN.
3000-LTV-RULES.
    IF TX-LTV-RATIO > 90
        MOVE 'Y' TO MI-REQUIRED
        MOVE 0.0025 TO RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
